  "title": "Control-rule parity: pump stations switched by wet-well level",
  "description": "A 90-node sanitary network (SI units) with two pump stations whose pumps are switched ON and OFF by IF/THEN rules on wet-well depth (e.g. pump U433_Psan_1_ou_2 switches 74 times in 36 h). Tests that a candidate evaluates control rules at the same moments as SWMM 5.2.4. Case v2.0.0 replaces EXTRAN Example 1 with a rule whose condition never changed, so v1 never exercised a switch.",
